{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"124099","name":"Sayanora Hotel","description":"This hotel is perfectly situated to explore Antalya-Side, 800 m from Side city centre and 200 m from the beach. The airport is about 50 minutes away by car form the complex. With its convenient location, and public transportation links close to the hotel, it offers easy access to the city's must-see attractions. Manavgat Waterfall and the town of Manavgat are both a 20-minute drive away. There are several restaurants, cafés and bars in the surroundings, they are ideal for the ones who like to explore delicious flavours. Guests can rest and enjoy the sun by sunbathing on a sun lounger by the side of the outdoor swimming pool or diving in it for a refreshing swim. The rooms are decorated with warm colours to create a cosy atmosphere and make travellers feel welcomed and have unforgettable holidays.","address":"Selimiye Mh Begonya Sk Nr:15, 15 3","city":"SIDE","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07330","lat":36.7755704,"lng":31.3940813,"stars":4,"giataCode":"62732","phone":"+902427535852","email":"sales@sayanorahotel.com","website":"www.sayanorahotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124099/124099a_hb_a_010.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124099/124099a_hb_a_020.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124099/124099a_hb_a_021.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124099/124099a_hb_a_027.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124099/124099a_hb_a_028.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124099/124099a_hb_a_032.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124099/124099a_hb_a_033.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelb